## Instructions & Usage

### 1. Build the Multi-Stage Docker Image
From the project directory `/root/code/ml-serve/`, build the tagged image:

```bash
docker build -t ml-serve:v1 .
2. Verify the Image
Confirm the image exists locally:

Bash
docker images ml-serve:v1
3. Run the Container
Start the container in detached mode and map port 8090 on the host to port 8080 in the container:

Bash
docker run -d --name ml-serve-app --rm -p 8090:8080 ml-serve:v1
4. Test the Health Endpoint
Verify that the service is running and responding correctly:

Bash
curl http://localhost:8090/health
Expected Response:

JSON
{"status": "ok"}
5. Clean Up
Stop the test container when finished:

Bash
docker stop ml-serve-app
